    <guid isPermaLink="false">6714dc9b0d2f24f28971c8a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Oct 2024 10:34:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目邀请了好朋友：路人甲，来一起录制我们童年的经典广告。 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>看剧中跳不过的广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>小时候烦恼的广告，竟成了我们共同的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>经典旺仔系列广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a>我们用了20年才撕开了健达奇趣蛋的包装&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a>最爱看食品的广告，看了就是吃了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a>广告歌曲广为传唱&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a>给趣多多点豆给苏打饼干打孔&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>太太乐鸡精兑鸡汤&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>明星与广告的捆绑&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a>公益广告的暖心时刻&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a>神州行我看行，3G时代&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a>学生时代的告白神奇&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a>结束曲 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls79ST-LrUZLd0WfkQOQgSvTL2sh.m4a" length="86725823" type="audio/mp4"/>
