  <item>
    <title>8.鲜艳的红领巾飘扬在前胸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2d49f2adfe48b832a3f2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f2d49f2adfe48b832a3f2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2024 15:02:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于赶在九月末把教师节特辑发了出来，借着本月的教师节，给各位教师朋友们说一句迟来的：教师节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a>时间管理大师——英语老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a>老师的惩罚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a>妈妈也是第一次当妈啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>小学时代的桃园结义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>不可貌相的男同学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a>早恋风波——做老师也尊重同学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>被封锁的记忆——女性成长遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a>早恋中雌竞的女老师，温情的其他老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>最喜欢的潇洒历史老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a>第一次和朝朝的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>写小本本的高中生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a>“人生就要死磕！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a>奇怪的语文老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a>草船借“问题”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a>栗子和男朋友的早年历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a>栗子的超绝好舍友们！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a>结束曲</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llk9nt6VcPZ5wKdJwz8KGmNNtDKp.m4a" length="88898985" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiC1-3AXiO4FAuhrJan597oUD6BK.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>8</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>7.酷酷的我们一起抽寂寞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d04acad06ec988f2b9b3c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d04acad06ec988f2b9b3c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 10:17:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们做非主流的那些年度过的欢乐的、治愈的时光。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 邻市出行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>我们当非主流时的时代眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>腾讯系列：腾讯微博、QQ网名、偷菜小游戏、电子宠物、QQ会员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a>电脑课上的4399小游戏、QQ炫舞 、见网友的荒诞经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a>何炅泄露大家的QQ号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>微信小程序游戏摸鱼游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>实体游戏的伤心往事、受伤被治愈的小学时光、纯真的赤子心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a>此情可待成追忆，只是当时已惘然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a>阿姨，我的生命球能生孩子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>原来火力少年王真的存在啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>现实版虚拟货币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>年轻人就是好，倒头就能睡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a>你们家朝朝骑电动车睡着啦！城市中真的遍布眼线&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lglfMHQTAogmvkrZAYm7I_Sv-Jz-.m4a" length="86569566" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:50</itunes:duration>
